{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2817a958428bc156387b36eee5ddb0d1b21fb189c9e3035278cc0c778419c9f2", "ja": "ファイト～！！\n……あれ？　これはなんか違うかな。", "zh": "加油——！！\n……咦？好像有点不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f53f586c6fb798753f8fd2cf43b2c841cd1bb405209d9ed082ce8e2b9f371881", "ja": "青羽さん？　どうしたんですか、\nなんだか気合いが入っているみたいですけど。", "zh": "青羽小姐？怎么了？感觉你好像干劲十足的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "10e013a827d7df95c5aeed7eea0b2f1702bc50cf9460a37854e97ccf013fc17e", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n今ちょっと、闘争本能を高めてたんです！　えへへ……", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我刚才正在提升自己的斗争本能！嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "1b01553ec9d6d5be086835a20b5d704207a4f698fe9f961f764061d2370838a5", "ja": "新年度も始まったし、私も事務員として、\nもっとアグレッシブになった方がいいかも、と思って。", "zh": "新学期也开始了，我想作为事务员，或许也该变得更积极进取一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "36118b8618c3864cadeab1756534e00a39fcaaba3ffde850de0c6e0793f9dfe0", "ja": "なるほど、わかります。プロデュースにも、\n強い気持ちが必要な時がありますから。", "zh": "原来如此，我明白了。有时候，制作偶像也需要坚定的决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "c31e54a6e7c7a0a23a27fa6b156415c6ca45f1ce9db47783373c8acec23f949d", "ja": "ですよね！　一緒に、業界で生き抜いていける\n強さを身に付けましょう！　うおぉーっ！", "zh": "就是嘛！一起锻炼出能够在这个行业生存下去的坚强意志吧！呜哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "89adc894142c87b19579a61757c75603f1863a5b6a3723363087cd8abef2a271", "ja": "そうですね！　一緒に……うおぉーっ！", "zh": "是啊！一起……呜哦哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "96be4cf505312cf13a71b2ffc14d8cd0d5cd8b316baff3eddda9a9310a4c5d89", "ja": "はっ、そういえば、社長さんがお呼びでしたよ。\n何でも、次の企画の話だとか……！", "zh": "啊，对了，说起来，社长刚才叫您过去哦。\n好像是要谈下一个企划……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9028d44422d4f9b729409135070673b374e5ac908db745e99b57e9b1f49ae339", "ja": "本当ですか！？\nいよいよだ……！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n终于要开始了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "439dac44fbe4351b1a2d56a23630630248824ae2e75d925152c8d57cffaf8e4c", "ja": "また、新しい戦いが始まるんですね……。\n私にできる事があったら、なんでも言ってくださいね！", "zh": "又要开始新的战斗了呢……\n要是有什么我能帮上忙的，请尽管吩咐哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fe9c17a77716feb03a242cf97656e28be2c77d4148a18de127c85cf5023479f4", "ja": "はい、頼りにしてます！\nそれじゃあ、行ってきます！　うおおおぉーっ！", "zh": "好的，就拜托你了！\n那么，我出发了！呜哦哦哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "b837eb48062220461e95e76a1335aa3868762fc79563d10c7071641b6cdca045", "ja": "おおっ、君、来てくれたか！　待っていたよ。\n……おや、どうしたのかね？　そんなに息を切らせて。", "zh": "哦哦，你来了啊！我一直在等你。\n……哎呀，这是怎么了？怎么喘得这么厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "51e10d265c15463f1a77e851fb507515343e59003b5cb31ffb208790268f7115", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ……いえ、ちょっと闘争本能が\n高まってしまって。全速力で走ってきたんです！", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊……没事，只是争强好胜的本能一下子高涨起来了。我是全速跑过来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "96a798ee0392238035d682e7515f344442e2ca81a748b76c49a27f75c7e7829b", "ja": "眉毛がキリッとして、姿勢も前のめりで……今日の\n{$P$}さん、迫力がありますね。", "zh": "眉毛也变得凌厉起来，姿势也向前倾着……今天的{$P$}先生，真有气势呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "6beffcbb69a8de6b259e2a6cf547a268a0d955b0df32f04565b84f80708161b4", "ja": "いいじゃないか！　そんな君だからこそ、\n新しい企画を任せたいと思うんだ。聞いてくれるかね？", "zh": "这不是很好吗！正因为是这样的你，我才想把新的企划交给你。愿意听我说说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4250a9c7dafa110f4e7df5c5cdbfb0e0c6599fbe1991014039a8621dbdf3833c", "ja": "やっぱり、そのお話でしたか。\nはい、ぜひ聞かせてください！", "zh": "果然是这个话题啊。\n好的，请务必告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "ae07e080a13553250624272ff8b77b80d4452479a5abec41d19c69e8019f7f3b", "ja": "うむ！　昨今、我らがアイドル業界にも、様々な\n変化が押し寄せてきている……そうだね？　音無君。", "zh": "嗯！近来，我们偶像业界也迎来了各种各样的\n变化之浪潮……对吧？音无君。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "214ac8f97d5a80322be07a8f6cd9ebe438c535ddeab2296b4e616c93ce86e5be", "ja": "ええ、社長。技術の進歩や、配信環境の多様化……\nファンとしても、追いかけるのが大変なくらいです。", "zh": "是的，社长。技术的进步、直播环境的多样化……就连作为粉丝，想要追上这些变化也很不容易。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "20877c152265087e3de7b36343714d8c7722eccee5271617194b1c8db24ed99e", "ja": "その通り。しかし、そんな状況でも、アイドル諸君は\n戦わなければいけない……高みを目指して。", "zh": "正是如此。然而，即使身处那样的境地，偶像们也必须战斗……为了向更高处迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "ecd09c9f777872a31316b06035886f016fc8f1b55a3c455e256773f5f992d054", "ja": "トップに立てるのは、ほんの一握りのアイドルだけ……\nそれだけは変わらない、真理です。", "zh": "能登上顶峰的，只有极少数偶像……\n这点始终不会改变，这是不变的真理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c3bb173d98d6ef75b913dcdff6d021eedaf89795a4a766d0859e0250db161471", "ja": "お、おお……おふたりとも、\nなんだか息がピッタリですね！", "zh": "哦、哦哦……两位还真是，\n配合得天衣无缝呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "d155a7bdd7c26bb46700f1704694af6ab0d69d450040d6ab322e9edb59155fcb", "ja": "はい！　実は社長と、朝から練習してたんです。\n完璧なプレゼンを見せたいから、って。", "zh": "是的！其实我从早上开始就和社长一起练习了。\n因为想让大家看到完美的演示嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "1155f2abf2b043576c96c314076009f5534965215bbcfbce2658b811fc6350d5", "ja": "音無君！　それは言わぬが花というものだよ。\nまあいい、とにかく……ウォッホン！", "zh": "音无！我不是说过不要揭穿我吗！？\n算了，总之……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "229d097dcaee82d00e7f1e6383548cd11dd4250d81f106777cda23561f29168e", "ja": "そんなアイドル業界で勝ち抜いていくための競争力、\n勝負強さを、アイドル諸君には身に付けてもらいたい。", "zh": "希望各位偶像掌握在这样的偶像界中脱颖而出的竞争力和临场取胜的实力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "f0f135078efcdb202cd4cdfa35f491fbdbcfdeecddbce05c210ada97d9e6285e", "ja": "そこで……今ここに、\n『BATTLE OF THEATER』の開催を宣言する！", "zh": "因此……现在，在这里，\n我宣布《BATTLE OF THEATER》正式开幕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e8efe32ed6b0f542902450b551deadd8a3c27c92352edf824ab17ce64cb8e72b", "ja": "BATTLE OF THEATER！？\nそ、それは一体……！", "zh": "BATTLE OF THEATER！？\n那、那是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "7d6fe651c7c008978e69ccd43e7ea895126a8acf5807e151766764ab4b93e2c9", "ja": "劇場のアイドル諸君を3つに分けたグループ、", "zh": "将剧场的偶像们分成3组的分组，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "f2ef8acd7804d4273fe96dd15bcad09d01e38ea79f9969d9c614c27286e0fd39", "ja": "PRINCESS STARS、FAIRY STARS、\nそしてANGEL STARS。", "zh": "PRINCESS STARS、FAIRY STARS，\n以及ANGEL STARS。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "72dfa4fb5ef02351bbcdd39433afaa778a8fe271fbf85d1f23ba0b2ab513f727", "ja": "今回はそれを更に2つに分け、計6チームで\nステージで競い合ってもらう！", "zh": "这次会再将其分成2组，由总计6支队伍在舞台上一决高下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "c8a15fbc792d11e42c5cc9438504552f3bdca36a4db1ca702096720695547137", "ja": "シーズンを通しての総合優勝は、PRINCESS、\nFAIRY、ANGEL、3つのグループ単位で決めるが……", "zh": "赛季总冠军将以PRINCESS、FAIRY、ANGEL这3个组合为单位来决定，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "9dba18410a54340f5193d6b718b4f830d13f760a8c518d0e3e8cf1e705e7ca8f", "ja": "その上で、最優秀賞のチームを決めたいと思う！", "zh": "在此基础上，我想选出获得最优秀奖的队伍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "f8e30ffb86bfc29b1742f63d4ddc3832aa1e0bedf6e3ff0473ef30374c4db1bf", "ja": "同じPRINCESS、FAIRY、ANGELのグループ同士\nでも、お互いをライバルとして競い合ってほしい！", "zh": "希望即使是同在PRINCESS、FAIRY、ANGEL分组里的\n成员之间，也能将彼此视作竞争对手相互切磋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "031fd10f22533c832e19cd3060d0e86bf198c7fc892e14604be38cbb14a34f39", "ja": "なるほど、ステージの上で真剣勝負を……\nそれは熱いですね！", "zh": "原来如此，要在舞台上认真较量一番……\n那可真是热血啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "7cf8c709e949bd24f4d08be5637270ea0bc52c644f1dd610162ef833acaf0419", "ja": "ただ戦うだけではなく、ちゃんと決着もつけて\nもらおうと思っているよ。敗者なくして勝者なし、だ。", "zh": "我不只是想让你们战斗，也希望能好好分出胜负。没有败者，就没有胜者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "3e118e83f134dc9112f3fe9e6c98a67d43ffa536c057a3ed2533f939ca235314", "ja": "そうなると、ちょっとだけ心配ですけど……。\nでも、みんなの本気の輝き、私も見てみたいです！", "zh": "真要那样的话，我还是有点担心……  \n不过，我也想看看大家全力以赴时的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "b836b484b33c83e44c44634de66854641630ac9418dac1cc469c50ced29c69d7", "ja": "誰と誰に戦ってもらうか……チームの人選は、\n君に任せたい。頼めるかね？", "zh": "让谁和谁来对决……队伍的人选，\n我想交给你来决定。能拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_1037", "source_sha256": "a1b71818fed28ef682a623afe3ab2531134cfd4eb301456319f451c326315eb4", "ja": "引き受ける", "zh": "接受", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c306a555f8b853985564e5dae6f2e3e7422fd6b7d02eeded7e556535288aab70", "ja": "わかりました！　勝ち負けに伴う、アイドル達への\nフォローも含めて、しっかりプロデュースします。", "zh": "明白了！我会把胜负带给偶像们的关照也包括在内，\n认真做好制作工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "8f90218ffd90faabbffc4e7a81ae13011c21b629f6e02d28e76b7ff4129b0457", "ja": "{$P$}さんがそう言ってくれるなら、\n安心して見ていられそうですね。楽しみです♪", "zh": "既然{$P$}先生都这么说了，\n那就可以放心看着了呢。真让人期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "2bf5ca58a1b4b17c90b03ca95043b72c2b3ccc9f982bf72e99e7bb19e1a5bc0a", "ja": "うむ！　しかし、勝負は次回から。\nまずは、開催宣言公演ということで……。", "zh": "嗯！不过，胜负要从下次才开始。\n首先作为举办宣言公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "e14a8b1bb59f6e691077d30ce22ffacd1e75c047fb2da8adeb74d46040f6003c", "ja": "勝ち負けは一旦置いて、パーッといこうじゃないか！\n思いきり盛り上げてくれたまえ。よろしく頼んだよ～！", "zh": "先把胜负放到一边，痛痛快快地来一场吧！\n尽情把气氛炒热起来。拜托你了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "863a4f012bd75b270ab6639d22900519a5ac0c7c7528d077f57dddcee1ddc557", "ja": "（さすがは、社長だな……これは面白い企画に\nなりそうだ。闘争本能が、燃えたぎってきたぞ！）", "zh": "（不愧是社长啊……看来这会变成一个有趣的企划。\n我的战斗本能已经熊熊燃烧起来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
